@startuml
' Figure 47.4  The evaluation scenario from both sides
' Reading order: top to bottom. The interviewer brings a new model;
' the candidate measures in shadow; the interviewer asks what blocks
' the move; the green arrow is the release with its blocking
' condition, signed by its owner; the interviewer writes the check.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Interviewer" as I <<org>>
participant "Candidate" as C <<org>>
participant "Release" as R <<verified>>
I -> C : New model arrives
C -> C : Golden set, shadow
I -> C : What blocks it?
C -[$VERIFIED]> R : Block on regression
R -> R : Owner signs
I -> I : Writes first check
@enduml
